    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of logic and color in <i>Color Pathways</i> \u2014 a relaxing yet challenging puzzle game that tests your mind with 60 handcrafted levels of colorful connection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Color Pathways</i>, your goal is simple: connect matching colored nodes without crossing paths. But as the grid fills and the complexity rises, only the most clever players will master every level. Whether you're in for a quick mental workout or hours of strategic thinking, <i>Color Pathways</i> offers a beautifully designed, minimalist puzzle experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>60 Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Gradually increasing difficulty for both casual and hardcore puzzlers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Colorful, Clean Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Neon lines, smooth animations, and a soothing UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Brain-Training Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Engage your logic, pattern recognition, and spatial skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Instant Restarts</strong> \u2013 Made a mistake? Retry instantly without frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Ambient Sound Design</strong> \u2013 Optional relaxing audio for a zen-like focus mode.</p></li></ul>",
